% Test cases for the tumor treatment field therapy policy
% (tumor_treatment_field.le): synthetic monthly rental claims, one or two
% per criterion of LCD L34823 and per payment condition of Policy Article
% A52711, each stating only what its record shows. Therapy begins on the day
% the device is delivered. The queries: whether the claim is payable (the
% first query, so "stage" reads its checklist), whether it is reasonable and
% necessary, and what minimal change would make it payable.

the target language is: prolog.

the knowledge base tumor_treatment_field cases includes these resources:
    tumor_treatment_field.

the knowledge base tumor_treatment_field cases includes:

query pay is:
    which claim is payable.

query rn is:
    which claim is reasonable and necessary.

query stage is:
    the query fails at which section.

query flip is:
    which minimal change to the scenario makes it the case that
        claim 1 is payable.

% A complete first-month claim: a newly diagnosed supratentorial GBM (WHO
% grade IV), debulking surgery, chemoradiation ending on 25 March, the
% device delivered 26 days later, no progression, KPS 80, the expected daily
% use, the diagnosis on the claim, the order and the delivery.
scenario first_month_complete is:
    claim 1 is for the TTFT device.
    the HCPCS code of the TTFT device is "E0766".
    the TTFT device is furnished to Ann.
    the residence of Ann is private residence.
    the date of service of claim 1 is 2026-04-20.
    the rental month of claim 1 is 1.
    the WHO grade of the histologically confirmed astrocytoma of Ann is 4.
    the glioblastoma of Ann is newly diagnosed.
    the glioblastoma of Ann is supratentorial.
    Ann had maximal debulking surgery of the glioblastoma.
    the last dose of concomitant chemotherapy of Ann was on 2026-03-20.
    the last dose of concomitant radiotherapy of Ann was on 2026-03-25.
    the finding disease progression absent about Ann is established, according to the treating practitioner, because "the post-radiation MRI shows stable disease by RANO criteria".
    the Karnofsky performance score of Ann is 80.
    the finding full daily use expected about Ann is established, according to the treating practitioner.
    claim 1 states the diagnosis code of the beneficiary.
    the order for the TTFT device is dated 2026-04-10.
    the order for the TTFT device is signed by the treating practitioner.
    the order for the TTFT device includes beneficiary name.
    the order for the TTFT device includes order date.
    the order for the TTFT device includes description of the item.
    the order for the TTFT device includes quantity to be dispensed.
    the order for the TTFT device includes treating practitioner name.
    the order for the TTFT device was communicated to the supplier on 2026-04-12.
    the TTFT device was delivered on 2026-04-20.
    the supplier holds proof of delivery for the TTFT device.
    pay expects answers ["claim 1 is payable"].
    rn expects answers ["claim 1 is reasonable and necessary"].
    stage expects answers [].

% The same claim without the diagnosis code on it: reasonable and
% necessary, not payable.
scenario no_diagnosis_on_claim is:
    claim 1 is for the TTFT device.
    the HCPCS code of the TTFT device is "E0766".
    the TTFT device is furnished to Ann.
    the residence of Ann is private residence.
    the date of service of claim 1 is 2026-04-20.
    the rental month of claim 1 is 1.
    the WHO grade of the histologically confirmed astrocytoma of Ann is 4.
    the glioblastoma of Ann is newly diagnosed.
    the glioblastoma of Ann is supratentorial.
    Ann had maximal debulking surgery of the glioblastoma.
    the last dose of concomitant chemotherapy of Ann was on 2026-03-20.
    the last dose of concomitant radiotherapy of Ann was on 2026-03-25.
    the finding disease progression absent about Ann is established, according to the treating practitioner.
    the Karnofsky performance score of Ann is 80.
    the finding full daily use expected about Ann is established, according to the treating practitioner.
    the order for the TTFT device is dated 2026-04-10.
    the order for the TTFT device is signed by the treating practitioner.
    the order for the TTFT device includes beneficiary name.
    the order for the TTFT device includes order date.
    the order for the TTFT device includes description of the item.
    the order for the TTFT device includes quantity to be dispensed.
    the order for the TTFT device includes treating practitioner name.
    the order for the TTFT device was communicated to the supplier on 2026-04-12.
    the TTFT device was delivered on 2026-04-20.
    the supplier holds proof of delivery for the TTFT device.
    pay expects answers [].
    rn expects answers ["claim 1 is reasonable and necessary"].
    stage expects answers ["the query fails at remedy"].
    flip expects changes [["add: claim 1 states the diagnosis code of the beneficiary"]].

% Therapy started 60 days after the radiotherapy ended (more than 7 weeks):
% criterion 3 fails. Surgery was not feasible, which criterion 2 allows.
scenario late_initiation is:
    claim 1 is for the TTFT device.
    the HCPCS code of the TTFT device is "E0766".
    the TTFT device is furnished to Ben.
    the residence of Ben is private residence.
    the rental month of claim 1 is 1.
    the WHO grade of the histologically confirmed astrocytoma of Ben is 4.
    the glioblastoma of Ben is newly diagnosed.
    the glioblastoma of Ben is supratentorial.
    debulking surgery was not feasible for Ben.
    the last dose of concomitant chemotherapy of Ben was on 2026-03-20.
    the last dose of concomitant radiotherapy of Ben was on 2026-03-25.
    the finding disease progression absent about Ben is established, according to the treating practitioner.
    the Karnofsky performance score of Ben is 90.
    the finding full daily use expected about Ben is established, according to the treating practitioner.
    the TTFT device was delivered on 2026-05-24.
    rn expects answers [].
    stage expects answers ["the query fails at question"].

% A Karnofsky score of 60 (claim 1), and a recurrent GBM, not newly
